- `javac RabinKarp.java && java RabinKarp` succeeds and prints `0 8`.
- I attempted extra edge-case checks through `jshell`, but the sandboxed JShell environment failed/hung on its execution and preferences setup.
- `RabinKarp.class` was generated by compilation and is ignored by `.gitignore`; shell cleanup was blocked by policy.

